We'll t[E]ake our leave and [Am]go

{comment: Verse  5}
For f[Am]orty days, or even more
The l[Dm]ine went slack, then t[Am]ight once more
All b[Am]oats were lost (there were only four)
But st[E]ill that whale did [Am]go

